# Reactions and the end-to-end padlock, in the direct conversation.
#
# A reaction is an annotation on a message, not a message: before the emoji flag was read at
# all it arrived as a bubble containing one emoji and no indication of what it was about. It is
# now filtered out of the transcript and drawn on the bubble it names, with identical emoji
# counted rather than repeated.

scene demo
tab messages

# Open the direct conversation with Bravo Creek.
key down 4
key a
hold 600

message in BRVO Found the crossing, about 200m upstream
hold 600

# One node agrees, then two more - the chip counts rather than repeating.
react HOME 👍
hold 500
react ALFA 👍
hold 500
react CHRL 🎉
hold 1400
